// Polities: chiefdoms and states (milestone 4). Runs once a year, after seafaring.
// Polities are organizations (the "organizations" table): each has a capital, a level (chiefdom
// or state), a temperament, and a set of positions left empty until named people come in
// milestone 6. Each land cell is ruled by at most one polity.
{
  // Temperament, drawn when a polity is founded: aggression (how readily it goes to war), greed
  // (how much tribute it takes) and expansion (how readily it draws in its neighbours). Each is
  // exp(temperamentSpread * a standard normal draw), kept between minTemperament and
  // maxTemperament, so most lie between about 0.7 and 1.4 and the typical one is 1.
  "temperamentSpread": 0.35,
  "minTemperament": 0.4,
  "maxTemperament": 2.5,

  // Positions every polity has, in order. They hold nobody until named people come (milestone 6).
  "positions": [ "Ruler", "Heir", "General" ]
}
